      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c87382f44f43f0cc75255fb"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "We can't still discard the possibility of them detecting the unexploded atomic warhead on Kamea's Kintaro and deciding not to risk it and join their WarShip at the jump point.\n\nBut it also seems likely that Captain Murray might have gained some hidden knowledge regarding these Periphery raiders and used it.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "And the 'IlChi' is just a dead end?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c08ac3d215bc39cc677b4b0"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cdfd7c535ed6c485c952cd2"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "I've done a search on the <i>Argo</i>'s records and whatever sources I can find and there is no reference to the term she used right before dying.\n\nPlus I am not even sure of how it's spelled, 'ilKee', ilKhi' or whatever it is, in my opinion likely some pirate lingo.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c161f2efc8d21994e3f5a07"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
