    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ce066510547dc6815a55d2b"
      },
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Well, since both the Kintaro and the Commander's 'Mech were disabled by Kitten before she ejected, so there's no recording of what happened afterwards.\n\nTheir reply to her challenge and them boarding the DropShips and leaving Coromodir afterwards was quite unexpected.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 10,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c347998f62db1b39be9bfcc"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c9a01873f100b11d5740ec7"
      },
      "index": 10,
      "text": "We assumed their leadership would be on the <i>Union</i> but the final lance disproved that.\n\nI wonder if Kitten already knew that they wouldn't be present there and so she decided to sabotage the destruction of the DropShip.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 11,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cb68ccd56c45190b08c51b4"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c5561e7d92e0f0344c6c008"
      },
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Their reply was still unexpected: they destroyed her 'Mech, took the remains with them inside the <i>Union</i>, and all of the Harbingers left the planet.\n\nWhatever quest ended there, I suspect it involved both parties.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
